        "created_at": "2015-07-28T18:31:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We were playing Kaagra and this comes up.&nbsp;</p><p>\"Kaagra hits highest fir four and hits the second highest fir three.\" How is this done? We've been doing it this way.&nbsp;</p><p>the highest and second highest are determined straight away from current hp. Should it instead be, she hits highest, and then if the highest is now second highest could be hit again?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>in the sense of the chairman, he has a card where operative deals the highest and then chairman deals the highest. For this we play that the first highest is hit and then, depending on the hps it could be someone else. Thoughts?</p>",
